{c: Verse 1}
[F#m]rainaa [C#]beetee jaaaaye,
[D]shaam [F#m]naa aaaaaye
[F#]nindeeyaa [B]naa aaaaye,
[F#]nindeeyaa [B]naa [C#]aaaaaye
[F#m]raina [C#]beeti jayen
[F#]shaam [B]ko bhoolaa,
